#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2253-B expect=skipped domain=TT
#note "DISCRIMINATOR (R-5.26): both columns are present, so Requirements.Variables.None [TTENRL] is unmet and this sibling SKIPS even though row 2 leaves both blank - that record is the parent FDA-SE2253's finding, not this sibling's. The four states are disjoint: no dataset is reported by two members of the family."
#library standard=sendig version=dart-1-1
dataset TT class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col RSTAGE  type=Char label="Description of Repro Stage"
col TTENRL  type=Char label="Repro Stage End Rule"
col TTDUR   type=Char label="Planned Duration of Repro Stage"
---
S1 | TT | ST1 | Premating | MATING SUCCESS | P14D
S1 | TT | ST2 | Gestation |  |
